;) R. Whyte","path":"Images/features/Chelicera%20basal%20segment/Direction%20in%20female/Intermediate%20angle.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/features/Chelicera%20basal%20segment/Direction%20in%20female/Intermediate%20angle.jpg","type":1}]},{"id":105,"uid":"dc20afe6-b3e3-4c74-89b5-d0251b7391da","name":"horizontal","type":0,"feature":50,"images":[{"caption":"Examples where the paturons are nearly at right-angles to the face<br/>Illustrators (and &copy;) R. Whyte (T), B.J. Richardson (B) (CSIRO)","path":"Images/features/Chelicera%20basal%20segment/Direction%20in%20female/Horizontal.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/features/Chelicera%20basal%20segment/Direction%20in%20female/Horizontal.jpg","type":1}]},{"id":106,"uid":"a163a199-e88b-4ce0-b28a-73e5ba521297","name":"short","type":0,"feature":51,"images":[{"caption":"Examples where the paturon is less than 1.3 the height of the face<br/>Illustrator (and &copy;) B.J. Richardson (CSIRO)","comments":"Beware of being misled by the shape of the paturon; it can look 'long and thin' but is still less than 1.3x the face height.","path":"Images/features/Chelicera%20basal%20segment/Shape%20in%20male/chelicera_male_short.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/features/Chelicera%20basal%20segment/Shape%20in%20male/chelicera_male_short.jpg","type":1}]},{"id":107,"uid":"fb1917ae-2d2b-41db-bd0b-2471d332951e","name":"elongate","type":0,"feature":51,"images":[{"caption":"Examples where the paturon is more than 1.4x the height of the face<br/>Illustrators (and &copy;) I.R. Macaulay (T), B.J. Richardson (B) (CSIRO)","comments":"Beware of being misled by the shape of the paturon; it can look 'long and thin' but is still less than 1.3x the face height.","path":"Images/features/Chelicera%20basal%20segment/Shape%20in%20male/chelicera_male_long.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/features/Chelicera%20basal%20segment/Shape%20in%20male/chelicera_male_long.jpg","type":1}]},{"id":108,"uid":"202697ce-4993-4c6f-b4a2-3d65d99e490d","name":"straight","type":0,"feature":52,"images":[{"capti