des_zabka_1991/plate_mopsolodes_live.jpg","type":1},{"caption":"<p>Aspects of the general morphology of Mopsolodes.</p><br/><p>Illustrators (and &copy;) B.J. Richardson (CSIRO), M. Zabka (diag.) (QMB).</p>","path":"Images/entities/mopsolodes_zabka_1991/plate_mopsolodes_preser_ved.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/entities/mopsolodes_zabka_1991/plate_mopsolodes_preser_ved.jpg","type":1},{"caption":"<p>Palp morphology of Mopsolodes.</p><br/><p>Ilustrators (&copy;), B.J. Richardson (CSIRO) and M. Zabka (diag.), (QMB).</p>","path":"Images/entities/mopsolodes_zabka_1991/plate_mopsolodes_palps.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/entities/mopsolodes_zabka_1991/plate_mopsolodes_palps.jpg","type":1},{"caption":"<p>Epigyne morphology of Mopsolodes.</p><br/><p>Illustrators (and &copy;), B.J. Richardson (CSIRO) and M. Zabka (diag.) (QMB).</p>","path":"Images/entities/mopsolodes_zabka_1991/plate_mopsolodes_epigyne.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/entities/mopsolodes_zabka_1991/plate_mopsolodes_epigyne.jpg","type":1}]},{"id":48,"uid":"9471a1fe-9241-4687-b332-064e7fb8ef8f","name":"Mopsus Karsch, 1878","type":1,"children":false,"parent":1,"text":[{"caption":"Fact Sheet","path":"Html/entities/mopsus_karsch_1878.htm","type":2}],"images":[{"caption":"<p>Examples of live Mopsus mormon.</p><br/><p>Illustrator (and &copy;) R. Whyte.</p>","comments":"<p>The green colour is soluble in alcohol and is lost immediately on preservation. Note the differences between females (top) and males (bottom).</p>","path":"Images/entities/mopsus_karsch_1878/plate_mopsus_live.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/entities/mopsus_karsch_1878/plate_mopsus_live.jpg","type":1},{"caption":"<p>Aspects of the general morphology of Mopsus mormon.</p><br/><p>Illustrators (and &copy;) B.J. Richardson (CSIRO), M. Zabka (diag.) (QMB).</p>","comments":"<p>Note the differences between females (top) and males (bottom).</p>","path":"Images/entities/mopsus_karsch_1878/plate_mopsus_preserved.jpg","thumb_path":"Thumbs/entities/mopsus_karsch_1878/plate_mopsus_pr